id: stretching
name: Stretching
kind: crafting
slots: 1
# "This piece of Apparel's Size Category is the current Size Category of this piece of
# Apparel's wearer." Read through apparelSize().
sizeIsWearers: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Its Size Category is always its wearer's.
# What it does, for the Effects on its Item's sheet: one line to an effect, each opening with
# its tag as the rulebook writes one - [Passive], [Automatic, 1/Encounter].
summary: >
  [Passive]: Its Size Category is always its wearer's.
text: >
  Stretching: It expands to almost ANY size.
  –Apparel Category: All
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –Quality Slots: 1
  –Effects: This piece of Apparel’s Size Category is the current Size Category of this piece of
  Apparel’s wearer.

---

# Its sheet says its Size follows whoever wears it. The Size rules - worn only at its Size, and
# destroyed when its wearer grows 2+ Size Categories past it - come with the rest of the Apparel
# rules, and read its Size through apparelSize() in module/gear.mjs: the wearer's own, always,
# so neither ever bites.
